              "instruction": "āmce māmā thoḍe tāpaṭ āhet. — Our uncle is a bit hot-tempered.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *āmce māmā thoḍe tāpaṭ āhet.* — Our uncle is a bit hot-tempered.]"
