          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संतापणे — santāpṇe — \"to be enraged; to fly into a rage\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खोटं ऐकून वडील संतापले. khoṭaṁ aikūn vaḍīl santāple. Father flew into a rage when he heard the lie."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो संतापला, to santāplā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Stronger than रागावणे. The noun संताप, rage: त्याला संताप आला."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संतापणे (santāpṇe) is a Marathi verb built on संताप, \"rage\", a tatsama from Sanskrit saṁtāpa, \"burning heat, affliction\" (CDIAL 12885)."
            }
          ]
        },
