          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चिडणे — ciḍṇe — \"to get irritated\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भाऊ खूप प्रश्न विचारतो, म्हणून ती चिडते. bhāū khūp praśna vicārto, mhaṇūn tī ciḍte. Her brother asks a lot of questions, so she gets irritated."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो चिडला, to ciḍlā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person one is cross with takes -वर: ती माझ्यावर चिडली. चिडवणे, to tease."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चिडणे (ciḍṇe) is a tadbhava, inherited from the reconstructed root ciḍ, \"be angry\"; CDIAL lists Marathi ciḍṇẽ, \"to be provoked\" (CDIAL 4794)."
            }
          ]
